  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of war-affected hospitals in Ukraine through emergency repairs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose/goal of this project is to perform light and medium-complexity repair works aimed at reconstructing 4 hospitals damaged by shelling in the war-affected regions of Mykolayiv and Kherson in Ukraine, thereby facilitating their secure reinstatement for operational purposes. Restoration activities include among other replacement of broken windows, repairs of damaged sections of the roof, internal repairs and repairs of hospital entrances.</narrative>
  </description>
